# Task train_16: every time the robot picks up at A, it must complete one
# of two options for that pickup: either reach the inspection station B
# one or two steps later and then eventually reach the delivery bay C (at
# or after that B), or reach the overflow dock D at that pickup step or
# later. Different pickups may use different options. Vacuously satisfied
# if A is never visited.
every(A, or(
    within(B, 1, 2, then=visit(C)),
    visit(D)
))
